sentences.text:
Accordingly, it is directed that in the event of his arrest, applicant- Anup Dixit shall be released on bail in relation to Crime No.287 of 2023 registered at Police Station Lahar District Bhind (M.P.) for the offence punishable under Sections 376(2)(n), 506 IPC, upon furnishing a personal bond in the sum of Rs.50,000/-(Rupees Fifty Thousand Only) with one solvent surety in the like amount to the satisfaction of the officer making arrest, for compliance with the following conditions:
(1) Applicant shall make himself available for investigation as may be directed by the officer, in-charge of investigation;
(2) Applicant shall not commit or get involved in any offence of similar nature;
Anup Dixit vs The State Of Madhya Pradesh on 18 December, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/194384112/
